<%# A small indicator that a file has notes. NOT a link — the enclosing card/row already links to
    the file detail page, whose Notes section is where the notes live. Local: `count` (Integer).
    The rail's note icon and the number; the TITLE carries the words ("2 notes"), which is where a
    status says what it means (design-system.md rule 13). It drew an emoji until slice 7. %>
<% if count.to_i.positive? %>
  <span class="note-badge" title="<%= count %> note<%= "s" unless count == 1 %>"><%= rail_icon(:note) %> <%= count %></span>
<% end %>
